# Local runtime is permanently off

This Windows machine must never run the trading bot or the local web panel.

Forbidden unless the user explicitly reverses this in writing:

- `pm2 start`, `pm2 restart`, `pm2 resurrect`, `npm run pm2:start`
- `python run_bot.py`, `python main.py` (live loop)
- starting `web/server.js` or opening the local panel to Start/Resume
- reinstalling `pm2-windows-startup` or adding a Windows Run/Task entry for PM2
- deleting `data/LOCAL_DISABLED`

If asked to "check", "test", or "debug" the bot locally: inspect code only. Do not launch processes.

The remote/VPS instance is out of scope unless the user names it.
